<title>UK: Eurotunnel trades up on debt deal relief.</title>
<headline>Eurotunnel trades up on debt deal relief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Eurotunnel Plc cranked up 7-1/2p to 89p on Friday as the market signalled relief after shareholders voted &quot;yes&quot; on a restructuring plan.</p>
<p>&quot;It's relief. Even though the approval was as expected, debt always going to be the issue and people are simply relieved,&quot; said a specialist salesman.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
</text>
